OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Israeli prime minister Mr Yitzhak
OL,6, Shamir has said his country is more
OL,7, determined than ever to hold on to the
OL,8, occupied territories.
OL,10,FHe was speaking at the funeral of a
OL,11,F15-year-old Israeli girl, killed
OL,12,Fyesterday by Palestinians throwing
OL,13,Frocks.
OL,14,V
OL,15,FThe girl, Tirza Porat, was the first
OL,16,FIsraeli civilian to be killed in the
OL,17,Funrest in the West Bank and Gaza Strip.
OL,19,S/FA young Palestinian has been shot
OL,20,Fdead in the West Bank, close to where
OL,21,Fthe Israeli girl was killed.
OL,23,T]Cfrom 07-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
